This NOTICE covers mage2x itself. The package has no runtime dependencies; the
installer runs on Node.js and the plugin runs under zsh, driving whichever of
docker, podman or kubectl is already present. None of those are bundled here.

mage2x succeeds mage2docker by Lukasz Olszewski
(https://github.com/lukaszolszewski/mage2docker), which was published under the
Beerware licence. mage2x is an independent implementation; no code was copied.
